2. Unjustified Charges : Upon checking my account after plan completion, I was shocked to find a new charge of {$810.00}. I was told these fees stem from : * Bankruptcy-related charges ( despite not being in bankruptcy ), * Property inspection fees resulting from BSIs incorrect reporting of my account as delinquent. 
