4. Failure to Correct Credit Reporting : BSI has continually reported my mortgage as delinquent to credit bureaus, damaging my credit, despite being informed that the reporting would be corrected.

5. Refusal to Provide Documentation : I have requested a copy of the completed payment agreement, which has inexplicably disappeared from my account records. My request for a copy has been denied.

Summary of My Complaint : * BSI failed to properly notify me of payment increases. 
* They inaccurately placed my account in bankruptcy status. 
* They misapplied payments and falsely reported delinquencies. 
* They threatened foreclosure despite on-time payments. 
* They added unjustified fees and failed to remove them after multiple assurances. 
* They damaged my credit through repeated misreporting. 
* They refused to provide critical documentation regarding the payment agreement. 

This matter is deeply troubling and appears to involve negligence, deceptive servicing practices, and potential mortgage servicing fraud. I respectfully urge the CFPB to investigate thoroughly and advocate on my behalf. 

